SOTN Co-op

A co-op mod for Castlevania: Symphony of the Night. It contains no game data: on first launch
it makes the co-op disc from YOUR OWN copy of the game (USA, SLUS-00067). Castlevania and
Symphony of the Night are trademarks of Konami; this project is not affiliated with Konami.

SOTN Co-op (the launcher, the co-op module, the patches) is free software under the GNU Affero
General Public License, version 3 (LICENSE), like sotn-decomp, which it is built on.
Source: https://github.com/tucker-bower/sotn-coop

What the releases include, and under which licence (full texts in licenses/):
- SwanStation, the PlayStation emulator core: GPL-3.0. https://github.com/libretro/swanstation
- OpenBIOS, an open-source PlayStation BIOS from PCSX-Redux: MIT.
  https://github.com/grumpycoders/pcsx-redux (src/mips/openbios)
- sotn-decomp, by Xeeynamo and its contributors: AGPL-3.0. https://github.com/Xeeynamo/sotn-decomp
- SOTN Ultimate, by renanbianchi: AGPL-3.0. Ultimate Maria's glue (characters/maria-ultimate/mar2.c)
  is its src/maria_psp/mar2.c, with our co-op changes marked; Saturn Maria is its src/ric changes
  and maria_saturn headers (characters/maria-saturn), launcher/saturn_maria.py ports its
